  "instructions": {
    "title": "Your workplace violence petition: before you file (do not file this page)",
    "lines": [
      "This file has the Petition of Employer (WV-0101), the Order to Show Cause and Temporary Restraining Order (WV-0102) filled in as far as you can, a blank Response (WV-0104) and Proof of Service of Completed Response (WV-0105) with the case heading, a Proof of Personal Service (WV-0103) for the person who serves the papers, and the Notice of Exclusion (PNW-0102). The Confidential Form is a separate file. Do not print it with this one.",
      "File one petition for each employee you are asking to protect.",
      "Replace page 1 of the Order to Show Cause with the court's Cover Sheet. The clerk has it. The court fills in the hearing date, the case number, and the judge's signature.",
      "Sign and date the petition by hand. A person signs for the employer, under penalty of perjury, and gives their title.",
      "Print 5 copies of the petition and the Order to Show Cause, 3 of the Notice of Exclusion, and 1 of each of the other forms, unless the clerk tells you otherwise.",
      "Someone other than the employer serves the defendant with the petition, the Order to Show Cause, and the blank Response and Proof of Service forms. That person fills in the Proof of Personal Service.",
      "There is no fee to file a petition about violence or threats of violence (paragraph 18).",
      "This page is not part of your filing. Remove it before you file."
    ]
  },
